{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo gives you complete access to Life Dash's vibrant cartoon world and all its core gameplay features\u2014with one major catch: you're limited to several in-game week.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What's Included in This Demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complete Gameplay Experience:</strong> Make every decision that shapes your virtual life\u2014choose your career path, decide what to eat, when to study, and how to invest your hard-earned money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mini-Quest Adventures:</strong> Take on goal-based and time-based challenges that boost your happiness and teach you the game's mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Real-Time Progression:</strong> Watch your character advance through life week by week as your decisions compound into meaningful progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic Decision-Making:</strong> Experience the full range of choices\u2014from working various jobs to taking bold risks in the stock market</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What's Not Included in This Demo:</strong> This time-limited preview lets you experience everything Life Dash has to offer, but you won't be able to reach those final life goals or compete on the leaderboards against your friends. Think of it as your training ground\u2014master the mechanics, develop your strategy, and get ready to dominate when you dive into the full experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your virtual life awaits\u2014and trust us, you'll want to see how far you can really go in the full game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667870?t=1748931145","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667870/cf505efca46eeeba7ff47dc10a2f713e550b0555/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748931145","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati